sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant API as /chat
    participant CS as Chat Service
    participant P1 as Primary Provider
    participant P2 as Fallback Provider
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    U->>API: POST /chat?stream=true
    API->>CS: stream_chat(request)
    CS->>P1: start stream

    alt Primary provider does not support streaming
        CS->>P2: fallback before first token
        P2-->>CS: stream session
        loop token events
            CS-->>API: event: token
            API-->>U: event: token
        end
        P2-->>CS: final result
        CS->>DB: persist messages + usage
        DB-->>CS: committed
        CS-->>API: event: done
        API-->>U: event: done
    else Primary provider streams successfully
        P1-->>CS: stream session
        loop token events
            CS-->>API: event: token
            API-->>U: event: token
        end
        P1-->>CS: final result
        CS->>DB: persist messages + usage
        DB-->>CS: committed
        CS-->>API: event: done
        API-->>U: event: done
    else Error after partial stream emission
        P1-->>CS: streaming error
        Note over CS,P2: No fallback allowed after first emitted token
        CS-->>API: event: error
        API-->>U: event: error
    end
